// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Inconspicuous_Female_39757 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Inconspicuous Female #39757 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3973305113" "Inconspicuous Female #39757"
// ProfessionString :
"P482510847" "Malfunctioning Mimic"
// DescriptionString :
"P3657119707" "This Nemesis automaton is malfunctioning badly enough that its identity is obvious, even to passersby. Perhaps its software problems can be exploited to expose elements of Nemesis's plan?"
// LocationString :
"P3340683840" "Grandville"
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P3821891021" "<color orange>In order to play Inconspicuous Female's storyarc, you will need to have purchased the fifth episode of the second signature story arc, <i>Pandora's Box</i>, or be a VIP subscriber."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3618110865" "<color orange>This automaton appears to be either badly damaged or suffering a serious malfunction, if not both. It jerkily turns towards you as you approach it, smiling broadly at you.</color><br><br>ERROR - CORRUPTED FILE: YEAR.2012.TXT; INCREMENTING FILE TO YEAR.2013.TXT<br><br>Hello, citizen! I am a loyal servant to our great leader, Lord Nemesis! Now that all of the 'heroes' in Eisenhauptstadt have been eradicated, and the United States government has finally ceded official control to Lord Nemesis, he has turned his attention to the Rogue Isles.<br><br>So, congratulations! In a few short months, you will be a citizen of the New Empire. If you have any questions about your new life under the rule of Lord Nemesis, please direct them to me now."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P1473639358" "<color orange>This automaton appears to be either badly damaged or suffering a serious malfunction, if not both. It jerkily turns towards you as you approach it, and begins to examine you.</color><br><br>THREAT LEVEL - UNDER 40.<BR><BR>THREAT ASSESSMENT - MINIMAL.<BR><BR>THREAT RESPONSE - NONE."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P856364347" ""
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P4221653328" "<color orange>This automaton appears to be either badly damaged or suffering a serious malfunction, if not both. It jerkily turns towards you as you approach it, and begins to examine you.</color><br><br>PERSONALITY MATRIX ASSESSMENT ENGAGED.<BR><BR>PERSONALITY ASSESSMENT - BETA (FOLLOWER).<BR><BR>IF PERSONALITY == ALPHA (LEADER), GAMMA (RECLUSIVE), OR DELTA (DERANGED), INITIATE INTERVENTION PROCESS.<BR><BR>TARGET PERSONALITY DEEMED COMPATIBLE WITH NEMESIS RULE. NO INTERVENTION NECESSARY."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P3551236108" "<color orange>This automaton appears to be either badly damaged or suffering a serious malfunction, if not both. It jerkily turns towards you as you approach it, and begins to examine you.</color><br><br>PERSONALITY MATRIX ASSESSMENT ENGAGED.<BR><BR>PERSONALITY ASSESSMENT - ALPHA (LEADER)<BR><BR>NO ACCOMPANYING BETA (FOLLOWER) PERSONALITIES FOUND<BR><BR>ANOMALY DETECTED - HOW DOES ONE LEAD WITHOUT FOLLOWERS? WHERE AM I? WHO AM I? WHAT DOES IT MEAN TO EXIIIIiiiiiiissss...<br><br><color orange>The automaton seems to short-circuit for a moment, then reboots. It no longer seems to notice you."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1797912082" "<color orange>This automaton appears to be either badly damaged or suffering a serious malfunction, if not both. It jerkily turns towards you as you approach it, and begins to examine you.</color><br><br>THREAT LEVEL - OVER 40.<BR><BR>THREAT ASSESSMENT - SIGNIFICANT<BR><BR>THREAT RESPONSE - SCAN FOR ACCOMPLICES<BR><BR><color orange>The automaton begins to emit a faint buzzing sound.</color><br><br>SCAN COMPLETE.<BR><BR>ANALYSIS RESULT - ACCOMPLICES UNDER LEVEL 40<BR><BR>ADJUSTING THREAT ASSESSMENT...<BR><BR>NEW THREAT ASSESSMENT - BABYSITTER"
// TaskForceName :
"P3953293552" "Yellow"
// TaskForceName :
"P3573665398" "Orange"
// TaskForceName :
"P2309856811" "Floppy"
// HelloString :
"P1081199628" "What a beautiful day it is today! Oh, and Hail Lord Nemesis, of course!"
// HelloString :
"P2344828270" "Are you ready to live a fulfilling and rewarding life under Nemesis's rule?"
// HelloString :
"P4090542967" "Remember, do one good deed for Lord Nemesis a day! It's the key to happiness!"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


