// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Socrates 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Socrates 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3487774357" "Socrates"
// ProfessionString :
"P1336307793" "Warrior, Artist, Philosopher"
// DescriptionString :
"P1266563068" "Socrates is more than a member of Odysseus's eccentric cadre. He is also one of David Hill's closest friends and confidants. Though he comes off as somewhat self-important at times, Socrates constantly strives to better himself in all areas of life, and is fiercely loyal to those he deems worthy of respect."
// LocationString :
"P3437209096" "St. Martial"
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P2723647266" "<color orange>In order to play Socrates's storyarc, you will need to have purchased the third episode of the second signature story arc, <i>Pandora's Box</i>, or be a VIP subscriber."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3224158877" "Hail, {HeroName}. I am Socrates, son of Bill, and right-hand man to the great Odysseus. He has called upon me to aid you in your quest to find the fabled Pandora's Box, and I intend to do just that.<br><br><color orange>Socrates favors you with a broad smile.</color><br><br>I've heard much of your exploits from my colleagues. I must say, given the tales surrounding your name, that I am glad we are working together on this venture. They say that having {HeroName} as a foe is not to be envied."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P27388013" "I am... sorry, {HeroName}. Grand tales are sung of your exploits, but you are still not mighty enough for the tasks I would set before you. If you were to return at Level 40, however..."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P3287555282" "Your team needs to be bigger"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P2654846688" "What have we here? A messenger, sent by {Hero.gender=male his|her} master to entreat with me? I think not! I will speak only to the leader, no one else!"
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P41476939" "If you plan to take allies on this excursion, {HeroName}, I would ensure that they are truly by your side. <i>Literally</i>."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P2917228729" "You are mighty indeed, {HeroName}, but your followers are not. Unless you wish them an ignoble death, do not bring allies below Level 40 before me. We will be walking a dangerous path."
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// HelloString :
"P2050623436" "Hail, {HeroName}. Let us do great deeds together."
// IDontKnowYouString :
// NoTasksRemainingString :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
