// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : V_James_Harvan 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : James Harvan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4020996210" "James Harvan"
// ProfessionString :
"P723259059" "Renowned Archaeologist"
// DescriptionString :
"P1731782941" "James Harvan is known as the leading expert in research on artifacts from the Archaic period of Ancient Greece. While his peers acknowledge that much of his work is groundbreaking, he is still seen as a fairly unorthodox figure in the field of archaeology. This is primarily due to his insistence that much of Greek mythology, including references to supernatural events, are accurate depictions of history."
// LocationString :
"P607884113" "Sharkhead Isle"
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P3413445523" "<color orange>In order to play James Harvan's storyarc, you will need to have purchased the fourth episode of the second signature story arc, <i>Pandora's Box</i>, or be a VIP subscriber."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3854021666" "{HeroName}... thank you for coming. I know that our time working together has been a bit... <i>rocky</i>. And... and we've certainly had our setbacks. However, I still believe there is a way to salvage your original intent in finding Pandora's Box.<br><br>The powers loosed by the box are unstable, but they can still be harnessed. If you are still interested in doing so, I know of a method that may be able to <i>transform</i> the creatures that emanated from Pandora's Box back into a purer, more usable form of energy. Once that energy has been contained, we will be able to decide how to use it."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P1755274518" "I'm sorry, {HeroName}. It's hardly fair for someone in my position to be saying this, but... you just don't seem strong enough to handle the tasks ahead. I would feel safer if you were at least Level 40..."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
// NeedLargeTeam :
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P2793197285" "Ah... {HeroName}, was it? We may have met before. Still, Ms. Kayumanis has me under strict surveillance. I am only permitted to speak with your team leader."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P3162216544" "{HeroName}, I think I have a solution to our problems. Please, if you would, gather your organization here, before we proceed. We're going to need everyone present for this."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P300276570" "You may not like this, {HeroName}, but... I've noticed that some of your companions aren't quite as... <i>capable</i> as you are. If they're not at least Level 40, I don't think they'd be appropriate for the tasks ahead of us."
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// HelloString :
"P1182848638" "Good day, {HeroName}. I'm ready when you are."
// IDontKnowYouString :
// NoTasksRemainingString :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

